==English==

===Alternative spellings===
*[[lambast]] ''(UK)''

===Etymology===
First attested in 1637.  Probably from '''[[lam]]''' + '''[[baste]]'''

===Pronunciation===
*1: {{IPA|/læm.beɪst/}}
*2: {{IPA|/læm.bæst/}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|lambast|ing}}

# To give a [[thrash]]ing to; to [[beat]] severely.
# To [[scold]] or verbally [[reprimand]].

====Synonyms====
*{{italbrac|to give a thrashing to}}: [[beat]], [[hit]], [[thrash]]
*{{italbrac|to scold or verbally reprimand}}: [[berate]], [[scold]], [[tell off]]

